 my Baby Elephant Spraying Water cliparts. Let them inspire your creativity and bring a sense of joy and adventure to your projects.\n\n📁 CONTENT 📁\n18 high quality PNG files\ntransparent background\n300 DPI up to 6.8×6.8 inches\n2048x2048px",
